# The utility runs its Dart entry point directly and has no compiled
# artefact of its own; the kernel cache lives in the binding's
# .dart_tool/, which the binding's ignore file already covers. What
# this file keeps out of the index is anything a toolchain run from
# inside this directory would drop beside the sources, so the rule
# survives if the tree is ever consumed outside the repository root.
loop
*.dill
*.snapshot
*.aot
*.exe
